      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No 4 Summerstown Avenue is a semi-detached 3-bedroom residence within walking distance of Wilton Shopping Centre, Cork University Hospital, UCC and close to all amenities. Positioned in a quiet and mature residential setting this property offers great potential for modern city living.\r\n\r\nThe front garden has private parking and a side entrance to the private rear garden which is laid out in gravel and planting with a small garden shed, this area has potential to be a beautiful chill space to extend subject to planning permission. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation is generous with a living room to the front with fireplace. The kitchen/dining is to the rear and has fitted wooden units. \r\nUpstairs are three bedrooms (2 x double 1x single) and family bathroom. The main double bedroom 1 has built-in wardrobes, double bedroom 2 is spacious and the single room has built in wardrobe.\r\nFloor Area: 96m2\r\nSee the Floor Plans and Video for full details.\r\n\r\nThe house was underpinned in 2005 by Cumor Construction Ltd, Blarney, Co Cork\r\n\r\nMains services: Oil Fired Central Heating. PVC Double Glazed Windows."
      },
